# P1 swept over the whole carrier range in ring mode, then up-shift, on noise, dry and wet at -3 dB each (pan 64).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.2
track fx2
input noise 0.4
param p2 128
param pan 64
param level 255
gain 1
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
param p2 230 16
sweep p1 255 0 16 32
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
